{"narrative": "I noticed an account with Receivable Performance that I was unaware of. XX/XX/19 I disputed the account with the credit bureaus and Receivable Performance verified the account as accurate. I also sent a letter requesting validation ( Tracking XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX ) on XX/XX/19 and Receivable Performance failed to respond or provide the proper validation. Not only did they not provide me with validation. There is another company collecting on this SAME EXACT debt. This is illegal. Two companies can not collect on the same debt.

