{"narrative": "Hunter Warfield INC. sent a {$6000.00} collection to the credit bureau on XXXX XXXX XXXX  and was recently added and reported XXXX XXXX XXXX  Credit reporting laws ensure that bureaus report only 100 % accurate credit information. Every step must be taken to assure the information reported is completely accurate and correct. The following information therefor needs to be re-investigated. I respectfully request to be provided proof of this alleged item, specifically the contract with the credit collection or other instrument bearing my signature. 

Failing that, the item must be deleted from he report as soon as possible as I am liable for the debt with XXXX XXXX XXXX I do not have a contract with Hunter Warfield INC. 

I did report to the XXXX"}

{"narrative": "Well for one thing I've try a couple times to see if I can have my interest rate lower on my Wells Fargo Visa Card only to be rejected or given the round around game. 

